# Maanasa Narayan Portfolio - Cursor Rules & Agent Directives

- Framework: Astro 7, React, Tailwind CSS, Cloudflare Workers.
- Package Manager: Bun (use `bun run ...`, `bun test`).
- Agent Protocols Supported:
  - Agentic Resource Discovery (ARD): `/.well-known/ai-catalog.json`
  - Model Context Protocol (MCP): `/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json`
  - Microsoft NLWeb: `/ask` endpoint (JSON & SSE streaming)
  - WorkOS auth.md: `/auth.md` and RFC 9728 / RFC 8414 metadata
  - Accept-Markdown (RFC 9110): `Accept: text/markdown` content negotiation
  - Agent Skills: `/.well-known/agent-skills/index.json`
- Quality Checks: Run `bun run format:check`, `bun run lint`, `bun run check`, `bun test`.
